### ========================================
### PRODUCTOS - /api/products
### Reemplaza <TOKEN> con el token del login
### ========================================

### Crear producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "code": "MED-001",
  "name": "Acetaminofén 500mg",
  "description": "Analgésico y antipirético",
  "price": 5000.00,
  "stock": 100,
  "minStock": 10,
  "category": "Medicamentos"
}

### Actualizar producto
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "code": "MED-001",
  "name": "Acetaminofén 500mg actualizado",
  "description": "Analgésico antipirético mejorado",
  "price": 5500.00,
  "stock": 120,
  "minStock": 15,
  "category": "Medicamentos"
}

### Obtener producto por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Obtener producto por código
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/code/MED-001
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar solo productos activos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?active=true
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Buscar productos por nombre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=Acetaminof%C3%A9n
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Listar productos por categoría
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Medicamentos
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Productos que necesitan reabastecimiento (stock < minStock)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/restock-needed
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Reducir stock de un producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/reduce-stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Aumentar stock de un producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/increase-stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "quantity": 50
}

### Activar/Desactivar producto (toggle)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Eliminar producto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
